<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>SysON measurement qualification</title>
<style>body{font:15px system-ui;margin:0;background:#f5f7fa;color:#182638}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h1{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 8px}p{line-height:1.5}fieldset{border:1px solid #bcc9d9;border-radius:8px;background:white;padding:16px;display:grid;gap:12px}label{display:grid;gap:5px}textarea,select,button{font:inherit;padding:9px;border:1px solid #8a9cb3;border-radius:4px}textarea{min-height:70px;resize:vertical}button{background:#174f83;color:white;width:max-content;min-height:42px}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #bb6500;outline-offset:2px}.checks{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}.checks label{display:flex;align-items:center}.panels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,280px),1fr));gap:14px;margin:18px 0}.panel{min-width:0;background:white;padding:14px;border:1px solid #bcc9d9;border-radius:7px}.drawing{overflow:auto;max-width:100%;min-height:160px;padding:8px;border:1px dashed #a2b2c5}.node{box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #506b8c;background:#eef4fc;padding:8px}.node.note{background:#fff6cd}.node-label{display:inline-block;white-space:pre;padding:0}.result{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px ui-monospace,monospace}.hint{font-size:13px;color:#45576d}[role=status]{margin:12px 0;font-weight:600}footer{border-top:1px solid #bcc9d9;padding-top:12px}</style>
<main><h1>Measurement qualification</h1><p>This developer probe runs selected pinned source methods and the actual Rust measurement API in WebAssembly. It does not load the complete application.</p>
<fieldset><legend>Rendered label</legend><label for="label">Label text<textarea id="label">Vehicle 雪 🧭
Second line</textarea></label><label for="font">Font size<select id="font"><option value="14">14 px</option><option value="18">18 px</option><option value="24">24 px</option></select></label><div class="checks"><label><input type="checkbox" id="resized">Retain previous size</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="missing">Missing label</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="stale">Stale font observation</label></div><button id="measure" disabled>Measure labels</button></fieldset>
<div id="status" role="status">Loading Rust module…</div><div id="panels" class="panels"></div><footer class="hint">Package and view-frame methods read these real DOM rectangles. Note receives its model label height through an explicit fixture assignment from the measured rectangle. Local scrolling preserves long labels; full application rendering, accessibility and native artifact correspondence remain separate gates.</footer></main>
<script src="original-methods.js"></script><script src="wasm_client.js"></script><script src="measurement_fixture.js"></script></html>
